{"seq":3,"slug":"unsupervised-learning","title":"无监督学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations/unsupervised-learning","wordCount":1118,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"无监督学习\">无监督学习</h1><h2 id=\"什么是无监督学习\">什么是无监督学习</h2><p>无监督学习（Unsupervised Learning）是在没有标签的数据上进行学习的方法。与监督学习不同，模型需要自主发现数据中隐藏的模式、结构和分布规律。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;无标签数据 X&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;无监督算法&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;聚类结果&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;降维表示&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;异常检测&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;关联规则&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"无标签数据 X\"] --&gt; B[\"无监督算法\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"聚类结果\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"降维表示\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"异常检测\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"关联规则\"]</pre><p>无监督学习的核心挑战在于：没有&quot;正确答案&quot;作为参照，模型的好坏评估往往依赖领域知识和间接指标。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>无监督学习围绕四个概念展开，它们恰好对应下面四节：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>相似度（Similarity）</strong>：没有标签，&quot;像不像&quot;就成了唯一的组织依据——聚类度量样本之间的距离，降维度量方向上的方差。</li>\n<li><strong>簇（Cluster）</strong>：相似样本的集合。聚类算法寻找&quot;同簇内相似、异簇间相异&quot;的划分，难点在于&quot;簇数 K&quot;与&quot;簇形状&quot;都没有标准答案。</li>\n<li><strong>低维表示（Latent Representation）</strong>：把高维数据投影到低维空间后保留的结构，降维算法寻找它。</li>\n<li><strong>异常分数（Anomaly Score）</strong>：偏离正常分布的程度的量化度量，异常检测寻找它。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>前两个是&quot;分组&quot;问题，后两个是&quot;度量&quot;问题。它们共享同一个制约：<strong>没有&quot;正确答案&quot;作为参照，好坏评估只能依赖领域知识和间接指标</strong>——这正是监督学习与无监督学习的根本分野。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"聚类\">聚类</h2><p>聚类（Clustering）是将数据自动划分为若干组的过程，使得同组内的数据彼此相似，不同组的数据差异较大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"k-means-聚类\">K-Means 聚类</h3><p>K-Means 是最经典的聚类算法，通过迭代将数据点分配到最近的质心（centroid），并不断更新质心位置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;随机初始化 K 个质心&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;将每个数据点分配到最近质心&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;重新计算每个簇的质心&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;质心是否收敛？&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| B&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E[&quot;输出聚类结果&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"随机初始化 K 个质心\"] --&gt; B[\"将每个数据点分配到最近质心\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"重新计算每个簇的质心\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"质心是否收敛？\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"否\"| B\n    D --&gt;|\"是\"| E[\"输出聚类结果\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from sklearn.cluster import KMeans&#10;from sklearn.datasets import make_blobs&#10;&#10;X, y_true = make_blobs(n_samples=300, centers=4, cluster_std=0.6, random_state=42)&#10;&#10;kmeans = KMeans(n_clusters=4, random_state=42, n_init=10)&#10;y_pred = kmeans.fit_predict(X)&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;簇中心:\\n{kmeans.cluster_centers_}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;惯性（Inertia）: {kmeans.inertia_:.2f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;各簇样本数: {np.bincount(y_pred)}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.cluster </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KMeans</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> make_blobs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X, y_true </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> make_blobs(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">centers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cluster_std</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kmeans </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KMeans(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_clusters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_init</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y_pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kmeans.fit_predict(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"簇中心:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kmeans.cluster_centers_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"惯性（Inertia）: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kmeans.inertia_</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"各簇样本数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.bincount(y_pred)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>K-Means 的局限性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>局限</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>需要预设 K 值</td>\n<td>通常用肘部法则（Elbow Method）选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只能发现球形簇</td>\n<td>对非凸形状的簇效果差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对初始化敏感</td>\n<td>使用 K-Means++ 缓解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对异常值敏感</td>\n<td>异常值会拉偏质心</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"dbscan-聚类\">DBSCAN 聚类</h3><p>DBSCAN（Density-Based Spatial Clustering of Applications with Noise）基于密度进行聚类，能发现任意形状的簇并自动识别噪声点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.cluster import DBSCAN&#10;from sklearn.datasets import make_moons&#10;&#10;X, _ = make_moons(n_samples=300, noise=0.05, random_state=42)&#10;&#10;dbscan = DBSCAN(eps=0.2, min_samples=5)&#10;labels = dbscan.fit_predict(X)&#10;&#10;n_clusters = len(set(labels)) - (1 if -1 in labels else 0)&#10;n_noise = (labels == -1).sum()&#10;print(f&quot;发现簇数: {n_clusters}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;噪声点数: {n_noise}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.cluster </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DBSCAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> make_moons</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> make_moons(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">noise</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dbscan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DBSCAN(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">eps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dbscan.fit_predict(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_clusters </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(labels)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_noise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"发现簇数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_clusters</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"噪声点数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_noise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>K-Means</th>\n<th>DBSCAN</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>簇形状</td>\n<td>球形</td>\n<td>任意形状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需要指定 K</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否处理噪声</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（标记为 -1）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心参数</td>\n<td>n_clusters</td>\n<td>eps, min_samples</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(nKt)</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"降维\">降维</h2><p>降维（Dimensionality Reduction）将高维数据映射到低维空间，同时尽量保留数据的关键信息。降维的目的包括数据可视化、去除噪声和加速后续算法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主成分分析-pca\">主成分分析（PCA）</h3><p>PCA 通过线性变换将数据投影到方差最大的方向上，是最常用的降维方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;原始数据&lt;br/&gt;d 维&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;计算协方差矩阵&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;特征值分解&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;选择前 k 个&lt;br/&gt;主成分&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;投影到&lt;br/&gt;k 维空间&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"原始数据&lt;br/&gt;d 维\"] --&gt; B[\"计算协方差矩阵\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"特征值分解\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"选择前 k 个&lt;br/&gt;主成分\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"投影到&lt;br/&gt;k 维空间\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.decomposition import PCA&#10;from sklearn.datasets import load_digits&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;digits = load_digits()&#10;X = digits.data&#10;&#10;pca = PCA(n_components=2)&#10;X_2d = pca.fit_transform(X)&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;原始维度: {X.shape[1]}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;降维后维度: {X_2d.shape[1]}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;前 2 个主成分解释方差比: {pca.explained_variance_ratio_}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;累计解释方差: {pca.explained_variance_ratio_.sum():.2%}&quot;)&#10;&#10;pca_full = PCA().fit(X)&#10;cumsum = np.cumsum(pca_full.explained_variance_ratio_)&#10;n_95 = np.argmax(cumsum &gt;= 0.95) + 1&#10;print(f&quot;保留 95% 方差所需维度: {n_95}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.decomposition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PCA</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_digits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">digits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_digits()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digits.data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pca </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PCA(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_components</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_2d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pca.fit_transform(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原始维度: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"降维后维度: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_2d.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"前 2 个主成分解释方差比: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pca.explained_variance_ratio_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"累计解释方差: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pca.explained_variance_ratio_.sum()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pca_full </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PCA().fit(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cumsum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.cumsum(pca_full.explained_variance_ratio_)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_95 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.argmax(cumsum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"保留 95% 方差所需维度: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_95</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"t-sne\">t-SNE</h3><p>t-SNE（t-distributed Stochastic Neighbor Embedding）是一种非线性降维方法，特别适合数据可视化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.manifold import TSNE&#10;from sklearn.datasets import load_digits&#10;&#10;digits = load_digits()&#10;tsne = TSNE(n_components=2, perplexity=30, random_state=42)&#10;X_tsne = tsne.fit_transform(digits.data)&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;t-SNE 输出形状: {X_tsne.shape}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.manifold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TSNE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_digits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">digits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_digits()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tsne </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TSNE(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_components</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">perplexity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_tsne </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tsne.fit_transform(digits.data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"t-SNE 输出形状: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_tsne.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>是否可逆</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PCA</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>去噪、特征压缩</td>\n<td>近似可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t-SNE</td>\n<td>非线性</td>\n<td>高维数据可视化</td>\n<td>不可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UMAP</td>\n<td>非线性</td>\n<td>可视化、聚类预处理</td>\n<td>支持变换新数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"异常检测\">异常检测</h2><p>异常检测（Anomaly Detection）是识别数据中偏离正常模式的样本。无监督异常检测不需要异常标签，仅基于正常数据的分布特征来判断。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;输入数据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;学习正常数据分布&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;计算异常分数&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;超过阈值？&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E[&quot;标记为异常&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| F[&quot;标记为正常&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"输入数据\"] --&gt; B[\"学习正常数据分布\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"计算异常分数\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"超过阈值？\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"是\"| E[\"标记为异常\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"否\"| F[\"标记为正常\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.ensemble import IsolationForest&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;np.random.seed(42)&#10;X_normal = np.random.randn(200, 2)&#10;X_outliers = np.random.uniform(-4, 4, (20, 2))&#10;X = np.vstack([X_normal, X_outliers])&#10;&#10;iso_forest = IsolationForest(contamination=0.1, random_state=42)&#10;predictions = iso_forest.fit_predict(X)&#10;&#10;n_anomalies = (predictions == -1).sum()&#10;print(f&quot;检测到的异常数量: {n_anomalies}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;总样本数: {len(X)}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;异常比例: {n_anomalies / len(X):.1%}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.ensemble </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IsolationForest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.random.seed(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_normal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_outliers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.uniform(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.vstack([X_normal, X_outliers])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">iso_forest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IsolationForest(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">contamination</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">predictions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iso_forest.fit_predict(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_anomalies </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (predictions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"检测到的异常数量: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_anomalies</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"总样本数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(X)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"异常比例: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_anomalies </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(X)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用的异常检测方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Isolation Forest</td>\n<td>通过随机切分隔离异常点</td>\n<td>高效、可扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>One-Class SVM</td>\n<td>学习一个包围正常数据的边界</td>\n<td>适合高维数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LOF</td>\n<td>基于局部密度比较</td>\n<td>能检测局部异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自编码器</td>\n<td>重构误差大 → 异常</td>\n<td>适合复杂数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在实际项目中，无监督学习常作为数据探索的第一步。通过聚类了解数据分布，通过降维进行可视化，可以为后续的监督学习任务提供有价值的洞察。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>无监督学习在没有标签的情况下发现数据的内在结构，主要包括<strong>聚类、降维和异常检测</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>K-Means</strong> 简单高效但局限于球形簇，<strong>DBSCAN</strong> 能发现任意形状的簇并处理噪声。</li>\n<li><strong>PCA</strong> 是线性降维的首选方法，<strong>t-SNE/UMAP</strong> 适合非线性可视化。</li>\n<li><strong>异常检测</strong>在无标签场景下识别离群点，Isolation Forest 是通用性最强的方法之一。</li>\n<li>无监督学习常作为数据分析和特征工程的基础工具，为整个机器学习流程提供支撑。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无监督学习","id":"无监督学习"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是无监督学习","id":"什么是无监督学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"聚类","id":"聚类"},{"level":3,"text":"K-Means 聚类","id":"k-means-聚类"},{"level":3,"text":"DBSCAN 聚类","id":"dbscan-聚类"},{"level":2,"text":"降维","id":"降维"},{"level":3,"text":"主成分分析（PCA）","id":"主成分分析-pca"},{"level":3,"text":"t-SNE","id":"t-sne"},{"level":2,"text":"异常检测","id":"异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"监督学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations/supervised-learning"},"next":{"title":"评估指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations/evaluation-metrics"}}